            <ArticleTitle>Assessment and control of fungal allergens.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>455-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fungal sensitivity is a significant cause of allergic disease. Understanding the role fungi play in allergic disease, and how to best control exposure among those with allergy, can have important clinical ramifications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
